Injects the same fixture into every language — one abstract type
declaring one required method, one concrete implementor — and asserts on
the EMITTED ARTIFACT after the full pipeline: does a dispatches_to edge
run from the abstract type's method to the implementor's method?
Uniform fixtures mean an empty cell is an analyzer or linker gap, never
construct-absence.

Measured: 8 hard passes (java, csharp, go, typescript, scala, swift,
groovy, python) and 8 strict-xfail holes, each with its measured cause
and an owning tracker item.

THE ITEM THAT PRODUCED THIS COLUMN NAMED ONE OF THE EIGHT CAUSES.
INV-tihim was filed as "one fact, two homes" — the '::' separator
divergence — which is real and is Rust's cause alone. Four languages
gave three causes; sixteen gave eight: three producer gaps (php, cpp,
elixir), two consumer-vocabulary gaps (solidity, ruby), one anchoring
choice (rust), one missing edge (dart), one unrelated analyzer crash
(kotlin — this fixture has two bodied type declarations, exactly the
shape that makes that analyzer emit zero type symbols).

Two holes are audit-findings 0018's disease one layer over, on
Edge.edge_type. edge_types.py exports INHERITANCE_EDGE_TYPES =
{extends, implements, inherits}; only slice.py and ranking.py consume
it. cli.py hand-rolls a complete copy, _transitive_bases.py omits
inherits, inherited_calls.py has includes but omits inherits, and
type_hierarchy.py branches inline on two literals and never consults the
registry — five vocabularies, all disagreeing, against an ADR-0023 §3
instruction to call edge_types_on_axis() instead. Solidity emits
`inherits`, Ruby emits `includes`; both invisible. Filed as INV-nosoz.

Built to resist the ways this kind of gate goes quiet: end-to-end rather
than analyzer-only (WI-duguk's column read green for Swift while the
live slice was unmoved); corpus generated into tmp_path_factory rather
than tests/fixtures/ (the pipeline suppresses linkers under fixture
paths); strict xfail markers, never imperative pytest.xfail() —
mutation-tested, marking a passing language as a hole XPASSes and fails
the run; plus a liveness floor, a non-vacuity floor (>=6 hard passes so
the column cannot go green by becoming all-xfail), a scope-disjointness
check, and a declared not-applicable map with reasons.

One pipeline run over a polyglot corpus rather than 16 runs: 0.7s
instead of ~30s, per-language xfail granularity preserved.

New items filed: INV-nosoz (inheritance edge vocabulary), WI-lahub
(dart), WI-vitas (elixir).

